 4/\nSign-up needed\nThis event is part of the Institute of Criminology's P
 ublic Guest Seminar Series for Michaelmas Term 2026. A drinks reception fo
 llows the talk. These events are free and everyone is welcome. Please regi
 ster to attend either in-person or online by clicking the link at the bott
 om of this page. \n About In Memoriam Andreas von Hirsch (1934-2026) \n Th
 e Institute of Criminology is indebted to Andreas von Hirsch in many and p
 rofound ways. We will mention just three. First\, because he was a valued 
 member of the Institute for many years\; second because he was an extraord
 inarily generous benefactor\; and third because he was a towering intellec
 tual figure in his own right. He was a pioneering force in taking seriousl
 y the connections between criminology and related fields – and both crim
 inology and those other fields are much enriched by the interdisciplinary 
 relationships his work contributed so d
