 //www.law.cam.ac.uk/press/events/2026/12/cflpp-monthly-seminar-can-there-b
 e-feminist-general-jurisprudence\nDate/time: \n\n Tuesday 15 December 2026
  \n\n 3:00pm to 4:00pm\n\n Location: \n\n Online webinar\n\n About \n\n Th
 e Cambridge Forum for Legal & Political Philosophy will host its third 202
 6 Michaelmas Term monthly seminar on Tuesday\, December 15th\, at 3:00pm\,
  through Zoom. The seminar will be chaired by Ira Chadha-Sridhar\, who is 
 currently an Assistant Professor in the Warwick University Law School. The
